{"id":"avant","lemma":"avant","pos":"prep","rank":103,"glosses":["before (in time)","before (in space), in front of, ahead of"],"ipa":"/a.vɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/Fr-avant.ogg/Fr-avant.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Que faisais-tu avant ça ?","en":"What were you doing before this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334590","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Est-ce pire qu'avant ?","en":"Is it worse than before?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"worse, worst"},{"g":"that / what"},null]},{"text":"Je suis né avant toi.","en":"I was born before you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"to be born","l":"naître"},null,{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Où étais-tu avant ?","en":"Where were you earlier?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Je l'ai rencontré avant-hier.","en":"I met him the day before.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28635","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to meet","l":"rencontrer"},null,{"g":"yesterday"}]}]}